        "created_at": "2013-11-18T02:40:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Can anyone give me a quick breakdown of the Unity deck?</p>\n<p>I noticed that mine only has 39 cards currently and I want to figure out which one is missing.&nbsp; (A long search of the other decks did not turn up two cards stuck together, yet.&nbsp; And this turned up as I tried to track down a missing Ra card.&nbsp;  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_frowning_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_frowning_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_frowning_face:\"> )</p>\n<p>I suspect it's a Bee Bot since there are 3x Raptor and Platform Bots and I only can find 2x Bee Bots.</p>",
